TEST 10:
Add a product variation, select another color, and verify that its corresponding image appears.

TEST 11:
Add products to the cart and verify that the correct quantities and totals are calculated.

TEST 12:
Complete a COD checkout and verify that the order is saved in the database and visible in the admin dashboard.

TEST 13:
Test JazzCash and Easypaisa using the configured merchant test or approved payment process. Verify that unsuccessful payments cannot be marked as paid.

TEST 14:
Verify that an ordinary customer cannot access administrator functions or modify prices and inventory.

TEST 15:
Refresh the application, log out, log in again, and verify that the appropriate data remains available.

TEST 16:
Build and deploy the frontend, then verify that products, categories, banners, settings, and orders remain intact.

TEST 17:
